  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sahel evidence and design programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Learning and Evidence for New Strategies in the Sahel programme (LENS) will generate, and facilitate timely use of, context-relevant research, analysis and evidence products that inform UK engagements and influence those of others. This will be done through the French Development Agency (AFD) who will provide a mechanism to commission, strategically disseminate, and support the effective use of research and evidence products with target stakeholders at critical decision-making points.</narrative>
  </description>
